{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48873","headline":"龙门八韵 · 薛能","name":"龙门八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河浸华夷阔，山横宇宙雄。\n高波万丈泻，夏禹几年功。\n川迸晴明雨，林生旦暮风。\n人看飜进退，鸟性断西东。\n气逐云归海，声驱石落空。\n近身毛乍竖，当面语难通。\n沸沫归何处，盘涡傍此中。\n从来化鬐者，攀去路应同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48873.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48873","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}